{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:37:39+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-30T07:37:39+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"EMS-CHEMIE HOLDING AG","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Specialty Chemicals","country":"Switzerland","city":"Domat/Ems","website":"https://www.ems-group.com","employees":2617,"summary":"EMS-CHEMIE HOLDING AG engages in the polymers and specialty chemicals businesses in the Americas, Europe, Asia, and internationally. The company manufactures and sells polymers, such as polyamide granulates used in automotive and construction applications in the electro and electronics, optics, and other industrial sectors, as well as offers feasibility studies, design, prototypes, component testing, and mould optimization services. It also offers bonding, coating, sealing, and damping services for the automotive industry; and develops and produces fibers, bonding agents, fusible adhesives, and adhesive yarns for technical and textile applications, powder coatings, and reactive diluents. The company was founded in 1936 and is based in Domat/Ems, Switzerland.","exchange":"Swiss","currency":"CHF","financial_currency":"CHF","summary_fr":"EMS-CHEMIE HOLDING AG exerce ses activités dans les domaines des polymères et des produits chimiques de spécialité en Amérique, en Europe, en Asie et à l’international. La société fabrique et vend des polymères, tels que des granulés de polyamide utilisés dans les applications automobiles et de construction dans les secteurs de l'électro et de l'électronique, de l'optique et d'autres secteurs industriels, ainsi que des études de faisabilité, de la conception, des prototypes, des essais de composants et des services d'optimisation de moules. Elle offre également des services de collage, de revêtement, d'étanchéité et d'amortissement pour l'industrie automobile; et développe et produit des fibres, des agents de collage, des a